<figcaption class="caption">Brochures, stationery, signage and displays — your brand, made tangible.</figcaption></figure><section class="service-detail section"><div><span class="eyebrow">PRINT &amp; OUTDOOR</span><h2>From the big picture<br>to the finer details.</h2><div class="service-type-art" aria-hidden="true"><small>NITIKSHAM / PRINT</small><strong>Paper.</strong><span>Considered. Connected. Crafted.</span></div></div><div><div class="deliverable reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Brochures &amp; leaflets</h3><p>Printed pieces people keep — clear layouts, honest copy and paper that feels right in the hand, from a single leaflet to a full brochure.</p></div><div class="deliverable reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Corporate stationery</h3><p>Business cards, letterheads and envelopes that carry your identity into every meeting, parcel and handshake.</p></div><div class="deliverable reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Banners &amp; hoardings</h3><p>Large-format design that reads at a glance — bold, simple and unmistakably yours, from a shopfront banner to a roadside hoarding.</p></div><div class="deliverable reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Exhibition graphics</h3><p>Stands, backdrops and displays designed to stop people walking past — and to give your team something worth standing in front of.</p></div><p class="caption">Your project scope, deliverables and timeline are agreed after our first conversation.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Print that works as hard as your website</h2><p>Print is not the opposite of digital — it is the other half of it. The best brands feel the same in the hand as they do on screen.</p></div><div class="values"><article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Designed for the hand</h3><p>A brochure is picked up, folded, kept or passed on. We design for that moment — paper, size and finish chosen to suit the piece, not just the picture.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Designed for the street</h3><p>Outdoor advertising has seconds to work. We keep hoardings and signage simple: one message, one image, your name — readable from across the road.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Designed for the room</h3><p>Exhibition graphics, posters and in-store displays that fill a space with your brand — planned around how people actually move through it.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Consistent with your brand</h3><p>Every printed piece follows the same identity as your website and social feed — see our <a href="/expertise/">brand &amp; design</a> work — so your brand is recognisable wherever it appears.</p></article></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>From the screen to the street</h2></div><div class="two-copy"><p>A campaign does not end at the edge of a screen. The same idea can live on a hoarding, in a brochure and in a <a href="/digital-marketing/">digital marketing</a> campaign — each format doing what it does best, all of them saying the same thing.</p><p>We plan print alongside digital from the start, so nothing is an afterthought. And because the words matter as much as the layout, our <a href="/copyright/">copywriting</a> team writes the copy that goes on the page — clear, short and worth reading.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Print &amp; outdoor, answered</h2><p>The questions businesses ask us most before starting a print project.</p></div><div class="values"><article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>What print materials do you design?</h3><p>Brochures and leaflets, corporate stationery, banners, hoardings, signage and exhibition graphics — from a single business card to a full outdoor campaign.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Do you supply print-ready artwork?</h3><p>Yes. Every design is supplied as print-ready artwork, prepared to your printer’s specifications — correct sizes, bleed and colour settings — so it prints the way it was designed.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>What is outdoor advertising?</h3><p>Advertising people see outside their homes — hoardings, banners, shopfront signage and displays. It builds familiarity fast, especially in a local area, and works well alongside digital campaigns.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>04</span><h3>How does print fit with digital marketing?</h3><p>Print and digital reinforce each other. A brochure can carry a QR code to your website, a hoarding can repeat a campaign message people also see online, and both should look and sound like the same brand.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>05</span><h3>How long does a print project take?</h3><p>It depends on the scope — a leaflet can move quickly, while a full stationery set or exhibition stand takes longer. Your timeline is agreed after our first conversation, along with the scope and deliverables.</p></article></div></section><section class="new-cta"><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT TANGIBLE</span><h2>Something to hold.<br><em>Something to remember.</em></h2><p>Bring your brand into the real world with considered print and communication.</p><a class="button" href="/contact-us/">Start a conversation ↗</a></section></main><footer class="new-footer"><div class="footer-grid"><div><a class="wordmark brand-wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Nitiksham home"><img src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri()); ?>/assets/nitiksham-brand.png" alt="Nitiksham — an idea driven agency" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1239" height="308"></a><p>Strategy, creativity and digital.<br>Different skills. One clear direction.</p></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href="/about-us/">About</a><a href="/services/">Expertise</a><a href="/team/">The collective</a><a href="/gallery/">Gallery & newsletters</a></div><div><h3>Say hello</h3><a href="mailto:contact@nitiksham.com">contact@nitiksham.com</a><a href="tel:+917988567198">+91 79885 67198</a><p>Ground floor